{
  "version": "shadowplay.story.v1",
  "title": "The Buggy's Bumpy Road",
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "bump-title",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "The Buggy's Bumpy Road",
      "text": "The Buggy's Bumpy Road"
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-lamp",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-hello",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Tonight, {child|little one}, Mo is flying back to the moon, to see her friend, the little moon buggy."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-mo",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "arriving"
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-scenery",
      "type": "scenery",
      "set": "moon-road"
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-mo-rests",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.3,
      "restV": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-intro1",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Brum... brum... putt. There it is, on the long moon road."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-intro2",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "But the road is very bumpy tonight, and the buggy is too tired to drive home by itself."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-intro3",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Mo has an idea. Let's find some friends to help."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-want-car",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "car",
      "text": "Make a car: a fist, with two fingers pointing forward like its headlights."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-car-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A little car! Beep, beep. Its headlights shine on the road. Hop in, Mo."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-car-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-car-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.04,
      "text": "Brum, brum, along the road. The little buggy follows behind."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-car-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": -0.04,
      "restV": 0.08
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-car-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The car parks at the side of the road, and turns off its lights."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-dim1",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-digger-before",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Oh no. A pile of moon rocks, right across the road."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-want-digger",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "digger",
      "text": "Make a digger: a flat hand, bent down at the wrist, like a big scoop."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-digger-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "A digger! Scoop, lift, and drop. Climb in, Mo."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-digger-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-digger-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.15,
      "text": "Scoop, scoop, the digger clears the rocks away."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-digger-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.12,
      "restV": 0.08
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-digger-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The road is clear. The digger lowers its scoop, and rests."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-dim2",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.7
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-plane-before",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Now, which way is the garage? Someone needs to look from up high."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-want-plane",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "plane",
      "text": "Make an aeroplane: your thumb and your little finger out, like wings."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-plane-yes",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "An aeroplane! Its propeller spins round and round. Climb aboard, Mo."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-plane-ride",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "riding"
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-plane-carry",
      "type": "carry",
      "toU": 0.3,
      "text": "Fly up high, over the moon road. Look, there is the garage!",
      "minV": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-plane-land",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.26,
      "restV": 0.16
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-plane-bows",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "The aeroplane circles once, and lands softly on the moon."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-dim3",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.55
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-dark",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "The garage is just ahead. But its light is off, and it is very dark."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-gift",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Look! A small star is falling, just for us."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-want-cup",
      "type": "request",
      "shape": "cup",
      "text": "Cup your hands together, softly, and catch it."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-caught",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "You caught it. Shine it on the road."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-letgo",
      "type": "letgo",
      "text": "Now open your hands, and let it light the way home."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-free",
      "type": "release",
      "text": "There is the garage, with its door wide open."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-finale",
      "type": "finale",
      "seconds": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-home",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "The little buggy rolls inside. Its headlights blink once, twice, and go softly out."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-dim-last",
      "type": "lamp",
      "level": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-mo-sleep",
      "type": "moth",
      "mode": "resting",
      "restU": 0.1,
      "restV": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-goodnight",
      "type": "narrate",
      "text": "Goodnight, little buggy. Goodnight, car, digger and aeroplane. And goodnight, {child|little one}. Mo will see you tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-the-end",
      "type": "chapter",
      "chapter": "The End",
      "text": "The End"
    },
    {
      "id": "bump-end",
      "type": "end",
      "text": "The End"
    }
  ]
}
